		'link' => array(
			'title'           => 'Integrate Your Systems Seamlessly with IQ Link for SAP Business One',
			'description'     => 'Connect SAP B1 to POS, e-commerce platforms, WMS, CRM tools, or custom legacy software. IQ Link ensures real-time or scheduled data syncing while monitoring for inconsistencies, giving your operations a unified, error-resistant workflow.',
			'seo_title'       => 'IQ Link Integration Module for SAP Business One | Connect POS, HRIS, & More',
			'seo_description' => 'Use DyanmIQ\'s IQ Link to bring together the different types of software you may be using. Click here to learn more about this SAP Business One Integration!',
			'faqs'            => array(
				array( 'What types of systems can IQ Link integrate with SAP Business One?', '<p>IQ Link can connect SAP B1 with a wide range of systems, including:</p><ul><li>Point-of-Sale (POS) software</li><li>E-commerce platforms</li><li>Warehouse Management Systems (WMS)</li><li>CRM tools</li><li>Custom legacy systems</li></ul><p>If your software supports data exchange (via APIs, file-based imports, or database-level sync), it can likely be integrated through IQ Link.</p>' ),
				array( 'How does IQ Link handle data inconsistencies between systems?', '<p>IQ Link features a built-in status report that flags mismatched or missing data in real time. This allows users to proactively correct issues before they affect operations or reporting, helping maintain data integrity across connected systems.</p>' ),
				array( 'Is the integration done in real time or in batches?', '<p>IQ Link supports both real-time and scheduled (batch) data synchronization, depending on the needs and capabilities of the systems being integrated. Real-time syncing is ideal for operations like inventory or sales, while batch sync may suit reporting or legacy system updates.</p>' ),
				array( 'Can IQ Link be customized to fit our unique system architecture?', '<p>Yes. IQ Link is highly adaptable and can be configured to match your specific business logic, field mappings, and data transformation requirements. Our team will assess your existing infrastructure and develop a custom integration plan that works for your operations.</p>' ),
				array( 'How do we monitor or troubleshoot integration issues?', '<p>IQ Link includes a user-friendly dashboard where you can view integration logs, check status reports, and identify sync errors or delays. This transparency empowers your IT or operations team to quickly diagnose and resolve any issues.</p>' ),
				array( 'How long does integration with IQ Link usually take?', '<p>The timeline depends on the number of systems being integrated and the complexity of their data structures. Simple one-way connections can be set up in a matter of days, while more complex bi-directional syncs may take several weeks.</p>' ),
				array( 'How do we know if IQ Link is the right solution for our integration needs?', '<p>If you use multiple disconnected systems and want to centralize your data in SAP B1—or reduce the time spent on manual reconciliation—IQ Link is a smart solution. A consultation and system audit can help determine the best-fit integration strategy for your business.</p>' ),
				array( 'Will integrating systems via IQ Link affect our current SAP setup?', '<p>No. IQ Link is designed to integrate without disrupting your existing SAP Business One configuration. It works alongside your current setup and enhances it by bridging data between platforms.</p>' ),
			),
			'faq_heading'     => 'p',
			'sections'        => array(
				array(
					'type'    => 'faq',
				),
			),
		),
		'rem' => array(
			'title'           => 'Smarter Real Estate Management with IQ REM for SAP Business One',
			'description'     => 'Optimize your real estate sales and financial processes with IQ REM, the powerful SAP Business One add-on built for developers and real estate professionals.',
			'seo_title'       => 'SAP B1 Real Estate Management Module | Streamline Property Sales & Financials',
			'seo_description' => 'Optimize your leasing, sales, and property management with IQ REM, a powerful real estate management system designed for SAP B1.',
			'overview_title'  => 'Product Overview',
			'overview'        => array(
				'IQ REM is a powerful and versatile add-on for SAP Business One (SAP B1), specifically designed to streamline and enhance the management of real estate sales and associated financial transactions. Tailored for developers, real estate professionals, and businesses, IQ REM integrates seamlessly with SAP B1 to provide an all-in-one solution for handling the complexities of real estate operations.',
				'DynamIQ Real Estate Management empowers real estate businesses to focus on growth and customer satisfaction by reducing administrative burdens and increasing operational efficiency.',
